    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0600_oldwoman_03",
      "hash": "54f656f5b7b73738",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_01",
      "hash": "2bf9b58d7de5c4d2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BROCK: Hey! I didn’t expect to run into\\nyou here."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_02",
      "hash": "2bf9b48d7de5c31f",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m on my way back from visiting the Celadon\\nCity Gym.\\c\\nKeeping in touch with other Gym Leaders is\\npart of our duties, after all!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_03",
      "hash": "2bf9b38d7de5c16c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "The girls at that Gym all turned me away for\\nsome reason, though..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_04",
      "hash": "2bf9b28d7de5bfb9",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Actually, have some Pewter Crunchies!\\nI’d brought them as a gift to the Gym here."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0600_sys_01",
      "hash": "b2b5b4f4538dbccc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got Pewter Crunchies from Brock!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_05",
      "hash": "2bf9b18d7de5be06",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh, and you’re probably going to want some\\ntea after eating them. Pewter Crunchies can\\r\\nmake you thirsty."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0600_sys_02",
      "hash": "b2b5b7f4538dc1e5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got a cup of [VAR COLOR(0006)]Tea[VAR COLOR(0000)] from Brock!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_07",
      "hash": "2bf9af8d7de5baa0",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Ah! I don’t have enough left to give to that\\nthirsty guard now..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_06",
      "hash": "2bf9b08d7de5bc53",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Anyway, it looks like you’ve been visiting\\nthe Gyms in other cities! I wish you the best!"
    }
  ],
